TC01 - Login With Valid Credentials
    [Documentation]    Verify login using valid credentials and navigate to Products page
    [Tags]    Login    Positive

    # Perform login using valid username and password
    Login With Valid Credentials

    # Verify the Products page is displayed
    Verify Products Page

TC02 - Login With Invalid Credentials
    [Documentation]    Verify login error for invalid credentials
    [Tags]    Login    Negative

    # Return to login page
    Go To    ${URL}

    # Attempt login with invalid credentials
    Login With Credentials    ${INVALID_USERNAME}    ${INVALID_PASSWORD}

    # Verify an error message is displayed
    Verify Login Error Message

TC03 - Add Product To Cart
    [Documentation]    Verify a product can be added to the cart
    [Tags]    Cart    Positive

    # Return to login page and login
    Go To    ${URL}
    Login With Valid Credentials

    # Verify Products page
    Verify Products Page

    # Add Backpack to cart
    Add Product To Cart    ${PRODUCT_1}

    # Open cart
    Open Shopping Cart

    # Verify Backpack is displayed in the cart
    Verify Product In Cart    ${PRODUCT_1}

TC04 - Add Multiple Products And Checkout
    [Documentation]    Verify multiple products are listed in checkout summary
    [Tags]    Checkout    Positive

    # Return to login page and login
    Go To    ${URL}
    Login With Valid Credentials

    # Add multiple products to cart
    Add Product To Cart    ${PRODUCT_1}
    Add Product To Cart    ${PRODUCT_2}
    Add Product To Cart    ${PRODUCT_3}

    # Open cart
    Open Shopping Cart

    # Verify products are listed in cart
    Verify Product In Cart    ${PRODUCT_1}
    Verify Product In Cart    ${PRODUCT_2}
    Verify Product In Cart    ${PRODUCT_3}

    # Proceed to checkout
    Proceed To Checkout

    # Enter checkout details
    Enter Checkout Information

    # Verify checkout summary
    Verify Checkout Summary

    # Verify all three products are displayed
    Verify Checkout Products
